\par - Di\u7879\'3fn t\'edch ban c\'f4ng, l\'f4gia t\'ednh b\u7857\'3fng 50% (Sbc):
\par Ssd = Sc + Sp + 50% Sbc
\par N\u7871\'3fu nh\'e0 c\u7845\'3fp III tr\u7903\'3f xu\u7889\'3fng th\'ec:
